This target is a translation to Swift of osm2streets, streets_reader and osm2lanes (https://github.com/a-b-street/osm2streets, revision
fc119c4), used under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). The translation changes the
language; where it changes behaviour, the change is described in
Docs/PortingParity.md of this package.

It also translates abstutil's `Tags` and `wraparound_get`
(https://github.com/a-b-street/abstreet, revision ca1fb9a), used under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. It does not contain any part of Muv
(muv-osm, MPL-2.0): osm2lanes reads lanes from tags through Muv, which is
the separate target MuvLanes, under its own licence.
